{"blocks": [{"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobgLxl4E.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "『コインランドリー』\nMVが公開されました！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログを開いていただき、\nありがとうございます！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "埼玉県出身のえんどうりこです☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://youtu.be/ae6N-FcsJmQ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もうご覧になりましたか？👀"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobypFx5x.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "世界観も衣装もセットも全部素敵☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobxj97jJ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobom7U3F.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobT4xIMC.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobIHd8ZE.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "カメラ覗き込んでる☺︎\n微笑ましい。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobWvmxrJ.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ふふっ📸\nきれいだね、ゆったーん"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobdmpl5I.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobrNGm0p.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なにこの笑顔〜。\nかわいいいいいい"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobecHqkq.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "練習してる。\nかわいっ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobEfby0c.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mob87Gcwh.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ラスサビでみんなが踊ってるところを\nモニターで見てる時、\nみんなの可愛すぎる笑顔に心が浄化されていました🤫"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "モヤモヤした気持ちも\n「どうでもいいや〜」って！！笑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なにか嫌なことがあったときに\nこのMVを見てみよう、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ってそんな風にみんなの心を浄化できる存在になったらいいな〜☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mob7lOh2h.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobzI9z7x.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これ美味しいよーって\n教えてくれるかわいいきらさん。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ちゃんと食べました、美味しかったです☕️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "きらさんが隣にいてくださって心強いです☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobR8g9dN.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それでは、\n今日のブログはここまで！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後まで読んでいただき、\nありがとうございました〜。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "28日の20時から、\nSHOWROOM配信をやろうと思うのでぜひきてください🤫"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またね！"}], "source": "official"}